---
description: Secure GitHub and npm release automation
globs: ".github/workflows/*.yml, package.json, CHANGELOG.md, docs/publishing.md"
alwaysApply: false
---
- npm publishing uses Trusted Publishing (OIDC), not long-lived write tokens.
- Release workflow requires `id-token: write` and minimal other permissions.
- `package.json.repository.url` must exactly match the canonical GitHub repository.
- `package-lock.json` must be committed before release so CI uses `npm ci`.
- Release tag must match package version.
